    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br>This work is a game created at Byking Co., Ltd. training for new employees.<br>It may not function properly depending on your PC environment.<br>Also, unintended problems may occur in the game.<br>Please take note of this.<br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><br>The main character, Wrench, uses her &quot;Double Lariat&quot; to defeat many enemies and make the show more exciting!<br><br>The audience can enjoy the game by defeating many enemies at the same time or by defeating them in a row.<br>The audience will get excited by defeating many enemies at the same time or by defeating enemies one by one.<br><br>You can also defeat the audience, but be aware that your score will be deducted.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>I'm Wrench-chan! I love mechanics and I work as an engineer!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/8ae4421e89eed179c31ae160d027a991.avif?t=1743408867\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br> I wanted to test the durability of the machine.<br><br>I wanted to test the durability of the hand armor I had developed.<br>One day, I was invited to participate in a certain show!<br><br>It's a show where the more double lariat you do, the more the audience grows!<br><br>So cute!<br><br>Appearing on the show<br>If I can gather a large audience, it will be a great chance for everyone to know about my technical skills!<br><br>I'm still practicing the double lariat.<br>Sometimes I get dizzy when I spin around too much... but I'm sure it will be fine!<br><br>It will blow away all the other performers and make it the best show ever!<br><br>-SUPER LARIAT SHOW TIME! !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Performer</h2>You're at the show just like me!<br>There are some unique performers that aren't easy to blow away, so be careful!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/987ba7bf0dc00d908578c1e25c413d90.avif?t=1743408867\" width=616 height=250 /></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Audience SYSTEM</h2>Let's blow up the performers and get the audience excited!<br>If the conditions are met, they will flip a coin!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/09e76fa44202045a42dc8f3f711c9fe2.poster.avif?t=1743408867\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/09e76fa44202045a42dc8f3f711c9fe2.webm?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/09e76fa44202045a42dc8f3f711c9fe2.mp4?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Double Lariat Action</h2>Surprise the performer with my Double Lariat<br>Drift on the ground, spin action in the air<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/3b33b3d3da998964cb30885eabed518e.poster.avif?t=1743408867\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/3b33b3d3da998964cb30885eabed518e.webm?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/3b33b3d3da998964cb30885eabed518e.mp4?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/cfadc621f8191deaea71d26d5f52cd79.poster.avif?t=1743408867\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/cfadc621f8191deaea71d26d5f52cd79.webm?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/cfadc621f8191deaea71d26d5f52cd79.mp4?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fever Gauge</h2>If you keep spinning or get coins...<br>My deadly Fever Lariat will explode<br>Let's blow the performers away together<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/7f4c5b3b232dd168afbecd60a60717db.poster.avif?t=1743408867\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/7f4c5b3b232dd168afbecd60a60717db.webm?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/7f4c5b3b232dd168afbecd60a60717db.mp4?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Results SYSTEM</h2>How much excitement was there at the venue?<br>A rank will be displayed based on the excitement of the audience!<br>Aim for rank S!",
    "about_the_game": "\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br>This work is a game created at Byking Co., Ltd. training for new employees.<br>It may not function properly depending on your PC environment.<br>Also, unintended problems may occur in the game.<br>Please take note of this.<br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><br>The main character, Wrench, uses her &quot;Double Lariat&quot; to defeat many enemies and make the show more exciting!<br><br>The audience can enjoy the game by defeating many enemies at the same time or by defeating them in a row.<br>The audience will get excited by defeating many enemies at the same time or by defeating enemies one by one.<br><br>You can also defeat the audience, but be aware that your score will be deducted.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>I'm Wrench-chan! I love mechanics and I work as an engineer!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/8ae4421e89eed179c31ae160d027a991.avif?t=1743408867\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br> I wanted to test the durability of the machine.<br><br>I wanted to test the durability of the hand armor I had developed.<br>One day, I was invited to participate in a certain show!<br><br>It's a show where the more double lariat you do, the more the audience grows!<br><br>So cute!<br><br>Appearing on the show<br>If I can gather a large audience, it will be a great chance for everyone to know about my technical skills!<br><br>I'm still practicing the double lariat.<br>Sometimes I get dizzy when I spin around too much... but I'm sure it will be fine!<br><br>It will blow away all the other performers and make it the best show ever!<br><br>-SUPER LARIAT SHOW TIME! !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Performer</h2>You're at the show just like me!<br>There are some unique performers that aren't easy to blow away, so be careful!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/987ba7bf0dc00d908578c1e25c413d90.avif?t=1743408867\" width=616 height=250 /></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Audience SYSTEM</h2>Let's blow up the performers and get the audience excited!<br>If the conditions are met, they will flip a coin!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/09e76fa44202045a42dc8f3f711c9fe2.poster.avif?t=1743408867\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/09e76fa44202045a42dc8f3f711c9fe2.webm?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/09e76fa44202045a42dc8f3f711c9fe2.mp4?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Double Lariat Action</h2>Surprise the performer with my Double Lariat<br>Drift on the ground, spin action in the air<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/3b33b3d3da998964cb30885eabed518e.poster.avif?t=1743408867\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046520/extras/3b33b3d3da998964cb30885eabed518e.webm?t=1743408867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it